match-cheatsheet
================

match SUBJECT:
    case PATTERN [if GUARD]:
        BLOCK

literal      42  "go"  None  True
capture      name            (binds; never a dotted name)
wildcard     _               (matches anything; binds nothing)
value        Color.RED       (dotted name; compared with ==)
group        (pattern)
sequence     [a, b, *rest]   (not str, bytes or bytearray)
mapping      {"k": v, **rest}
class        Point(x, y=0)   (positional via __match_args__)
or           p1 | p2         (same names in every branch)
as           p as name

cases run top to bottom; the first match wins
a guard runs only after its pattern succeeded
